{
  "title": "Azure OpenAI Embedding Service Dashboard",
  "description": "Comprehensive monitoring for Azure OpenAI embedding operations and database performance",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Overview",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "id": 1,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Embedding Generation Rate",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.request_count{$env,$service}.as_count().rollup(sum, 60)",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Requests / Minute",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 2,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Embedding Generation Latency",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.generation_time{$env,$service} by {model}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "cool",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Latency (ms)",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              },
              "markers": [
                {
                  "value": "y = 1000",
                  "display_type": "warning dashed",
                  "label": "Warning"
                },
                {
                  "value": "y = 3000",
                  "display_type": "error dashed",
                  "label": "Critical"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 3,
            "definition": {
              "title": "API vs DB Latency",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.api_latency{$env,$service}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "API Latency"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.db_operation_time{$env,$service}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "cool",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "DB Latency"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Latency (ms)",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 4,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Token Usage",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.token_count{$env,$service}.rollup(sum, 3600)",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Tokens per Hour",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Rate Limits & API Quota",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "id": 6,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Rate Limit Utilization",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.rate_limit_utilization{$env,$service}",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "orange",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Utilization %",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": 0,
                "max": 100,
                "include_zero": true
              },
              "markers": [
                {
                  "value": "y = 80",
                  "display_type": "warning dashed",
                  "label": "Warning"
                },
                {
                  "value": "y = 95",
                  "display_type": "error dashed",
                  "label": "Critical"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 7,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Rate Limit Remaining",
              "type": "query_value",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "min:azure.openai.embedding.rate_limit_remaining{$env,$service}",
                  "aggregator": "last",
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": "<=",
                      "value": 100,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<=",
                      "value": 500,
                      "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": ">",
                      "value": 500,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 8,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Time Until Quota Reset",
              "type": "query_value",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "min:azure.openai.embedding.rate_limit_reset_seconds{$env,$service}",
                  "aggregator": "last",
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": "<=",
                      "value": 60,
                      "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": ">",
                      "value": 60,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "unit": "s"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 9,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Rate Limit Trends",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "min:azure.openai.embedding.rate_limit_remaining{$env,$service}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "Remaining"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "min:azure.openai.embedding.rate_limit_max{$env,$service}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "grey",
                    "line_type": "dashed",
                    "line_width": "thin"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "Max"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Requests",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Vector Database & Connection Pool",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "id": 11,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Connection Pool Utilization",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.pool_utilization{$env,$service}",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "cool",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Utilization %",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": 0,
                "max": 100,
                "include_zero": true
              },
              "markers": [
                {
                  "value": "y = 70",
                  "display_type": "warning dashed",
                  "label": "Warning"
                },
                {
                  "value": "y = 90",
                  "display_type": "error dashed",
                  "label": "Critical"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 12,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Connection Pool Stats",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.pool_total_connections{$env,$service}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "grey",
                    "line_type": "dashed",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "Total"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.pool_active_connections{$env,$service}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "green",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "Active"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.pool_idle_connections{$env,$service}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "blue",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "Idle"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.pool_waiting_requests{$env,$service}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "orange",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "Waiting"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Count",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 13,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Connection Acquire Time",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.connection_acquire_time{$env,$service}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Time (ms)",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              },
              "markers": [
                {
                  "value": "y = 100",
                  "display_type": "warning dashed",
                  "label": "Warning"
                },
                {
                  "value": "y = 500",
                  "display_type": "error dashed",
                  "label": "Critical"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 14,
            "definition": {
              "title": "DB Operation Types",
              "type": "toplist",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "top(sum:azure.openai.embedding.db_operation_time{$env,$service} by {operation_type}.as_count(), 10, 'sum', 'desc')",
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": ">",
                      "value": 1000,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": ">",
                      "value": 500,
                      "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<=",
                      "value": 500,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Errors & Performance Issues",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "id": 16,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Error Count",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.errors{$env,$service}.as_count().rollup(sum, 60)",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Errors / Minute",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 17,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Errors by Type",
              "type": "toplist",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "top(sum:azure.openai.embedding.errors{$env,$service} by {error_type}.as_count(), 10, 'sum', 'desc')"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 18,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Error Rate %",
              "type": "query_value",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "100 * sum:azure.openai.embedding.errors{$env,$service}.as_count() / (sum:azure.openai.embedding.request_count{$env,$service}.as_count() + sum:azure.openai.embedding.errors{$env,$service}.as_count())",
                  "aggregator": "avg",
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": ">",
                      "value": 5,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": ">",
                      "value": 1,
                      "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<=",
                      "value": 1,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 2,
              "unit": "%"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 19,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Slow Operations (>1s)",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.generation_time{$env,$service,operation:generate_embedding} by {model}.rollup(count, 60) > 1000",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Count / Minute",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Content & Usage Patterns",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "id": 21,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Content Length Distribution",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.request_count{$env,$service,text_length_tier:small}.as_count().rollup(sum, 300)",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "green",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "Small (<100 chars)"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.request_count{$env,$service,text_length_tier:medium}.as_count().rollup(sum, 300)",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "blue",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "Medium (100-500 chars)"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.request_count{$env,$service,text_length_tier:large}.as_count().rollup(sum, 300)",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "purple",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "Large (500-2000 chars)"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.request_count{$env,$service,text_length_tier:xlarge}.as_count().rollup(sum, 300)",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "orange",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "XLarge (>2000 chars)"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Count / 5min",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 22,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Average Text Length",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.text_length{$env,$service} by {model}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "cool",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Chars",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 23,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Operations by Type",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.request_count{$env,$service,operation:generate_embedding}.as_count().rollup(sum, 300)",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "cool",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "Generate Embedding"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.search_count{$env,$service}.as_count().rollup(sum, 300)",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "Similarity Search"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.store_count{$env,$service}.as_count().rollup(sum, 300)",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "green",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "alias": "Store Document"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Count / 5min",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 24,
            "definition": {
              "title": "Daily Token Usage Trend",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.token_count{$env,$service}.rollup(sum, 86400)",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "thick"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Tokens / Day",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Azure OpenAI Embedding Service Monitoring\n\nThis dashboard provides comprehensive monitoring for the Azure OpenAI embedding service integration. Key metrics to watch:\n\n- **Rate Limit Utilization**: Should stay below 80% to avoid throttling\n- **Connection Pool Utilization**: High utilization may require scaling the pool\n- **Error Rate**: Should stay below 1%\n- **Generation Latency**: Look for spikes that may indicate API issues\n\nThe metrics are gathered through our custom monitoring implementation in `src/lib/monitoring/azure-embedding-metrics.ts`.",
        "background_color": "gray",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": true,
        "tick_pos": "bottom",
        "tick_edge": "left"
      }
    }
  ],
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "default": "production",
      "prefix": "env",
      "available_values": [
        "production",
        "staging",
        "development"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "service",
      "default": "vector_search",
      "prefix": "service",
      "available_values": [
        "vector_search",
        "document_processing",
        "rag"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "is_read_only": false,
  "notify_list": []
}